namtor (0.3.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bound the suspend handler so it cannot burn logind's delay window on an
    in-flight authentication and sleep with the IR emitter lit.
  * Harden mmap_buffers against the buffer-mapping leak already fixed in
    request_buffers.
  * Add a timeout_ms= PAM module argument.
  * Keep gettext msgids stable for messages with runtime parts.
  * Fix a test that depended on an artifact its own build never makes.

