namtor (0.3.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the settings app aborting when Save Profile is pressed.
  * Fix PAM toggles applying twice (two polkit prompts per switch).
  * Report enrollment workers that do not stop before suspend, which would
    otherwise leave the IR emitter armed while the journal claims otherwise.
  * Discard a save result for an enrollment the user already cancelled.
  * Keep the emitter watchdog armed when a force-off write fails; start the
    stream before lighting the emitter.
  * Take the emitter-state path as a parameter, not from the environment.
  * Make the screen-reader announcement throttle actually throttle.
  * Fix lifecycle.sh misreporting installed ONNX models.
  * Typed spec 8.3 failure conditions with a fault-injection matrix.

