namtor (0.3.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Stopping an enrollment scan no longer leaves the IR emitter lit on the
    Review screen; Resume re-arms it.
  * Pausing and resuming an enrollment no longer breaks face unlock until a
    daemon restart (leaked V4L2 buffer mappings caused EBUSY).
  * Close every capture on suspend, under a logind delay inhibitor.
  * Release the capture when a remote-host request is refused mid-session.
  * The SIGKILL emitter backstop re-resolves the camera by USB identity.
  * Saving a profile no longer freezes the window; unfinished scans ask first.
  * G1.5 measured on all four teardown paths, within the 200 ms budget.

